      </div>
      <p class="hint">Use the country calling code and phone number without a leading plus sign. Your number is sent to the pairing server to create your session.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head"><div class="icon">✓</div><div><h2>How to connect</h2><p class="sub">Complete the pairing from WhatsApp.</p></div></div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step"><span class="step-no">01</span><div><strong>Enter your number</strong><p>Select your country code and enter the WhatsApp number you want to connect.</p></div></div>
